      "start_line": 9,
      "text": "  rule countUpperEven(CODES:IntSeq)\n    => (#if strContains(\n                  iCons(intSeqAt(CODES, 0), .IntSeq),\n                  strToCodes(\"AEIOU\"))\n        #then 1 #else 0 #fi)\n       +Int countUpperEven(\n         buildIS(\n           CODES,\n           clampHi(2, isLen(CODES), 1),\n           isLen(CODES),\n           1))\n    requires notBool (CODES ==K .IntSeq)\n    [simplification]"
